{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34153","headline":"奉和袭美公斋四咏次韵 新竹 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美公斋四咏次韵 新竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别坞破苔藓，严城树轩楹。\n恭闻禀璇玑，化质离青冥。\n色可定鸡颈，实堪招凤翎。\n立窥五岭秀，坐对三都屏。\n晴月窈窕入，曙烟霏微生。\n昔者尚借宅，况来处宾庭。\n金罍纵倾倒，碧露还鲜醒。\n若非抱苦节，何以偶惟馨。\n徐观穉龙出，更赋锦苞零。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}